  "body": "[{\"nid\":[{\"value\":1294}],\"uuid\":[{\"value\":\"7609a0eb-5001-4864-bd6d-ad6af08b42ff\"}],\"vid\":[{\"value\":10706}],\"langcode\":[{\"value\":\"en\"}],\"type\":[{\"target_id\":\"page\",\"target_type\":\"node_type\",\"target_uuid\":\"427cd7c2-0e21-40fc-8a66-8dec6f66a44f\"}],\"revision_timestamp\":[{\"value\":\"2025-06-18T15:42:20+00:00\",\"format\":\"Y-m-d\\\\TH:i:sP\"}],\"revision_uid\":[{\"target_id\":36,\"target_type\":\"user\",\"target_uuid\":\"12bf6697-e372-4660-96bc-35e745c3c09d\",\"url\":\"\\/user\\/36\"}],\"status\":[{\"value\":true}],\"uid\":[{\"target_id\":1,\"target_type\":\"user\",\"target_uuid\":\"744e71b7-5444-4e00-a95a-b007efa4c640\",\"url\":\"\\/user\\/1\"}],\"title\":[{\"value\":\"About the Common Metabolic Diseases Knowledge Portal project\"}],\"created\":[{\"value\":\"2020-04-16T17:06:49+00:00\",\"format\":\"Y-m-d\\\\TH:i:sP\"}],\"changed\":[{\"value\":\"2025-06-18T15:42:20+00:00\",\"format\":\"Y-m-d\\\\TH:i:sP\"}],\"promote\":[{\"value\":false}],\"sticky\":[{\"value\":false}],\"default_langcode\":[{\"value\":true}],\"revision_translation_affected\":[{\"value\":true}],\"path\":[{\"alias\":null,\"pid\":null,\"langcode\":\"en\"}],\"body\":[{\"value\":\"\\u003Cdiv class=\\u0022col-md-9\\u0022\\u003E\\u003Ch5 class=\\u0022dk-under-header\\u0022\\u003EThe Common Metabolic Diseases Knowledge Portal (CMDKP) aggregates and analyzes genetic association results, epigenomic annotations, and results of computational prediction methods to provide\\u0026nbsp;data, visualizations, and tools in an open-access portal. The aim of the CMDKP is to facilitate research on the molecular basis of complex diseases, including type 1 and type 2 diabetes, cardiovascular and cerebrovascular disease, and sleep disorders. The RRID of the CMDKP is \\u003Ca href=\\u0022https:\\/\\/scicrunch.org\\/resources\\/data\\/record\\/nlx_144509-1\\/SCR_020937\\/resolver?q=scr_003743\\u0026amp;l=scr_003743\\u0026amp;i=rrid:scr_020937\\u0022 target=\\u0022_blank\\u0022\\u003ESC